    },
    {
      "id": "345:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你不能让查理把一切抛到脑后。你试着恳求他。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:78656:78679"
    },
    {
      "id": "345:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“值得。我们还有彼此。求你了，查理！”泪水从你脸上滑落。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:78679:78709"
    },
    {
      "id": "345:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "进行一次困难难度的说服检定。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:78709:78725"
    },
    {
      "id": "345:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定成功，转到 346。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:78725:78741"
    },
    {
      "id": "345:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定失败，转到 349。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:78741:78757"
    }
  ]
